   "your_version": "Note: throughout the exercise, allow your analytical part to make comments and/or tell you that it doesn’t like what you are doing. Just tell it that you will check things out when you come back and make any commitments etc when you are back. If it says no to going deeper, or tells you to stop doing the exercise, I’d stop there and not push past that no, even when it sounds like a prediction. You can stop whenever you want to. Remember that the images that you see can be meaningful without being actual memories of things that happened and just because you see an image, or feel a body release, that doesn’t mean that you are right about what is going on!",
