   "your_version": "Before you do what it wants you to do, see if it does any of the following: create a sense of urgency, secrecy, shame, threat of exclusion if you don’t do what it says, specialness, sexual charge, spiritual superiority, ask you for money, ask you for sex, ask you for loyalty, ask you to be quiet, ask you to obey it, try to limit your choices, make it seem like it’s bad to question it, act like not obeying it is a problem that needs to be solved, make normal life seem boring/stupid/irrelevant in its presence, try to seduce/scare/rescue your inner child, not let your adult self say no.",
